Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.95,0:00:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's party!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they all\Nwanna be fashionably late?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, face it, guys.\NNo one's coming to our first frat party.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be\Nthe worst night of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.93,0:00:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be\Nthe best night of our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.40,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheer up, guys.\NWe thought this might happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is why we came prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A door station?\NWhere did you get a door station?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.28,0:01:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Beach Ball to Throw Rug.\NCome in. Are you in position?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that, Beach Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.83,0:01:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O p e ra tio n Pa rty C e n tra I is a go.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mike, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not just gonna\Nthrow the biggest party of the year...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.53,0:01:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna steal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.83,0:01:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl was totally eyeing me.\NLike, all five eyeballs right at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I saw that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.72,0:01:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuzzy Rainbow to Beach Ball,\NI'm sending some your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Roll over, honey. You're snoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.90,0:02:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Party Central!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right!\N- Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, I saw your girlfriend\Nmaking out with some slug in the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.91,0:02:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Janelle? Whoa! Janelle! Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.54,0:02:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Janelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.38,0:02:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.26,0:02:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Righteous!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.26,0:02:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.39,0:02:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This party's lame.\NWhere are all the girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me! We need girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This party's lame.\NWhere are all the guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- How low can you go?\N- Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- How low can you go?\N{\i1}- A d ió s!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.36,0:03:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How low can you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Henry, wake up!\NSomething just went into the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing in our closet, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Food's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's get this party...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.93,0:03:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd everybody go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best party ever! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Squishy! Go Squishy! Go Squishy!\NGo Squishy! Go Squishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.81,0:03:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Scott Sebastian Squibbles!\NWhat is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom? It's not what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a door station?\NAre you boys door jamming?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.83,0:03:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no! Mom, Mom.\NWe were just... What's door jamming?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.58,0:03:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sherri! Sherri! Sherri!\NSherri! Sherri! Sherri!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom! I don't think this is a good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's it.\NThere definitely is something in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.18,0:04:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, fine.\NYou want me to check, I'll check.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.86,0:04:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.65,0:04:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing in our closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.55,0:04:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom! That was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's pledging Oozma Kappa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.01,0:05:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Timmy, can we sleep with you tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's monsters in our closet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I've been trying\Nto tell you!
